how far are you willing to go

00:59:56.420 --> 00:59:59.580
just to make other people happy and not yourself?

01:00:03.860 --> 01:00:05.700
I feel it's important that you,

01:00:09.660 --> 01:00:12.060
maybe another way to think about it is

01:00:12.060 --> 01:00:15.060
through the lens of regret that we've talked about before.

01:00:16.060 --> 01:00:18.460
Like, are you gonna regret staying in the military?

01:00:18.460 --> 01:00:21.540
Are you gonna regret not taking this chance

01:00:21.540 --> 01:00:22.740
to go and bet on yourself?

01:00:22.740 --> 01:00:25.020
Or is that gonna be a big regret for you?

01:00:26.260 --> 01:00:29.060
Because if you will,

01:00:29.060 --> 01:00:32.100
then you have to go and do something different.

01:00:32.100 --> 01:00:33.980
You have to go and try something new.

01:00:37.060 --> 01:00:41.300
I would love for everybody to get into the habit

01:00:41.300 --> 01:00:44.380
of getting used to, if you want something,

01:00:44.420 --> 01:00:46.460
then go out and try it

01:00:47.340 --> 01:00:51.460
and to stop living to other people's expectations.

01:00:51.460 --> 01:00:56.460
Like, even this, you're looking for our validation

01:00:56.540 --> 01:00:59.940
and that what you're doing is right

01:01:02.220 --> 01:01:03.380
and not weak.

01:01:03.380 --> 01:01:06.980
And really, the only person that you should impress

01:01:06.980 --> 01:01:07.860
is yourself.

