I'm here, I'm here, I'm here, guys.

01:01:16.020 --> 01:01:21.020
Sorry, I was feeling love for this question.

01:01:23.660 --> 01:01:25.020
I'd like to think that the people in my life

01:01:25.020 --> 01:01:27.620
would support me no matter what I do.

01:01:27.620 --> 01:01:29.780
But if they don't and I still wanna do it,

01:01:29.780 --> 01:01:31.540
I'm not seeking their approval.

01:01:32.580 --> 01:01:35.340
I'd love to have it, but I will not,

01:01:35.340 --> 01:01:37.380
I don't need to have their approval for me

01:01:37.380 --> 01:01:39.980
to go off and do the thing that I wanna do.

01:01:41.700 --> 01:01:43.340
And I think it's a key difference.

01:01:44.980 --> 01:01:46.460
And I think, as a parent, it's something

01:01:46.460 --> 01:01:51.260
that I'm trying to bring down to the next generation, too,

01:01:52.980 --> 01:01:57.380
is that I don't want, like, if Hayden wants to be a YouTuber,

01:01:57.380 --> 01:01:58.700
that's awesome.

01:01:58.700 --> 01:02:03.020
If he doesn't, that's awesome, you know?

