Or you may think that your future growth is so great

01:12:18.000 --> 01:12:20.320
that what you're doing now,

01:12:20.320 --> 01:12:23.040
I don't want to sell my company to Facebook yet.

01:12:23.040 --> 01:12:25.880
Facebook wanted to buy, well they bought Instagram,

01:12:25.880 --> 01:12:27.540
