and keep making new apps, that's going to be your home.

01:13:30.720 --> 01:13:33.540
You need to balance the priorities

01:13:33.540 --> 01:13:37.020
and then figure out what your walk away price is.

01:13:38.540 --> 01:13:40.540
And if you don't get the deal here,

