the more people will just pay more attention to you

01:13:47.420 --> 01:13:50.480
and the more opportunities you'll have

01:13:50.480 --> 01:13:54.720
to work with celebrities and to get bought by somebody.

01:13:56.500 --> 01:13:57.900
The best thing you can do to get noticed

01:13:57.900 --> 01:13:59.240
is keep doing great work.

01:14:00.500 --> 01:14:03.340
And if you understand, like it's just like anything else.

