Well, how important is the money you're making

01:14:07.420 --> 01:14:09.180
versus the flexibility you get

01:14:09.180 --> 01:14:11.540
versus the boss you're working with

01:14:11.540 --> 01:14:13.540
versus the work that you're actually going to be doing

01:14:13.540 --> 01:14:16.200
versus career advancement opportunities?

01:14:17.380 --> 01:14:18.580
How do you balance that?

01:14:18.580 --> 01:14:20.660
I don't know, there's a lot, like to you personally,

01:14:20.660 --> 01:14:22.660
there's a lot of different ways to go about doing it.

01:14:22.660 --> 01:14:24.340
It's figuring out for yourself

01:14:24.340 --> 01:14:26.140
what's the highest priority for you.

